    {"type":"text","id":"tproof","x":55,"y":665,"width":700,"height":120,"text":"PROPOSED EXIT TESTS (not run today)\nKnown-slug route test returns the event, not null\n3 live image PNGs show their own event titles\n3 image hashes differ from one another and the root card\nPR names the lookup failure; separately test a real share client","originalText":"PROPOSED EXIT TESTS (not run today)\nKnown-slug route test returns the event, not null\n3 live image PNGs show their own event titles\n3 image hashes differ from one another and the root card\nPR names the lookup failure; separately test a real share client","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":1,"containerId":"proof","textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","autoResize":true},
